The <ansi fg="command">Chrysalis Haste</ansi> spell floods the target's body with accelerating
Chrysalis energy, dramatically quickening movement and reflexes for
the duration. Targets under haste act with unnatural swiftness.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast chrysalis-haste [target]</ansi>

